    {
      "fileName": "cozy-campfire.json",
      "id": "n4yLaSzQlzyNOo6J",
      "name": "Cozy Campfire",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "n4yLaSzQlzyNOo6J",
        "folder": "ecygCZjU63FUN433",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Cozy Campfire",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You spend 1 hour building a campfire in a single unoccupied square and whispering the stories of those you've met on your journeys. The campfire sheds bright light in a 30-foot radius (and dim light for the next 30 feet). The campfire can't be put out or get larger through mundane means; it instead burns out after your next daily preparations or when you use this ability again.</p>\n<p>The first time each round a creature within the campfire's bright light performs an action with the attack trait, they must then attempt a @Check[will|against:class-spell] save against your class DC or spell DC (whichever is higher). This is a divine curse effect, and you are aware of any attempt, although other creatures in the area are not.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Cozy Campfire]</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is aware of the effect and can choose to disrupt their action. If they don't disrupt it, the campfire goes out.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is aware of the effect and can choose to disrupt their action. If they don't disrupt it, they become temporarily immune to the campfire's effects for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes a –2 status penalty to the action's attack roll and to all other attack rolls until the beginning of their next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The action is disrupted, and the creature takes a –2 status penalty to attack rolls until the beginning of their next turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Campfire Chronicler Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Rival Academies"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "subfeatures": {
            "proficiencies": {},
            "senses": {},
            "suppressedFeatures": []
          },
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "archetype",
              "consecration",
              "divine",
              "exploration",
              "fire"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 6,
      "category": "class"
